1372
01:13:12,600 --> 01:13:17,790
And then it should deny some
of the controversy theories,

1373
01:13:17,790 --> 01:13:19,680
even though I'm sure
that some people will

1374
01:13:19,680 --> 01:13:21,900
be very unhappy about that.

1375
01:13:21,900 --> 01:13:25,860
But well, we have to
decide something like that.

1376
01:13:25,860 --> 01:13:30,390
I am reasonably optimistic that
if humanities at large work

1377
01:13:30,390 --> 01:13:31,500
together, we can do that.

1378
01:13:31,500 --> 01:13:35,650
Because, after all, laws
are like that too, laws--

1379
01:13:35,650 --> 01:13:41,430
This is a human artifact that
people agreed upon somehow

1380
01:13:41,430 --> 01:13:45,310
that there's this core rules
that people should abide by.

1381
01:13:45,310 --> 01:13:48,900
So I'm hoping that we can
also define universals

1382
01:13:48,900 --> 01:13:51,870
and particulars and
respect particulars

1383
01:13:51,870 --> 01:13:55,080
whenever it's
respectful, otherwise

1384
01:13:55,080 --> 01:14:02,580
have some basic universals
that reflect core human values.

1385
01:14:02,580 --> 01:14:05,310
And then, as far as this
left-leaning situation,

1386
01:14:05,310 --> 01:14:08,850
by the way, if just the goal
is to make your AI systems

1387
01:14:08,850 --> 01:14:13,740
