1389
01:14:17,940 --> 01:14:20,580
And it's not going to
violate the freedom of speech

1390
01:14:20,580 --> 01:14:23,910
by doing so, just to make AI
to avoid the same things that

1391
01:14:23,910 --> 01:14:27,360
are potentially microaggression
for some population.

1392
01:14:27,360 --> 01:14:32,310
And we still don't
really exclude

1393
01:14:32,310 --> 01:14:35,310
