about freedom of speech

1394
01:14:35,310 --> 01:14:37,720
over equity by doing so.

1395
01:14:37,720 --> 01:14:39,000
So I think there are ways.

1396
01:14:39,000 --> 01:14:41,610
But this really requires
a lot more research,

1397
01:14:41,610 --> 01:14:42,780
is how I view it.

1398
01:14:42,780 --> 01:14:49,195

